{"id":"chatcmpl-02215230-cf8e-461d-b59d-ec6f5dad329e","object":"chat.completion","created":1795229894,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a strategy of recognizing when direct visual interpretation is ambiguous and delegating to a specialized expert tool for focused analysis. The key insight is that lateral views create left-right ambiguity, so the successful approach combined anatomical reasoning about typical lateral view positioning with expert confirmation. The pattern generalizes to any task where the primary evidence source has inherent ambiguity that a domain-specific tool can resolve.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When the primary evidence is ambiguous due to view/projection limitations, delegate to a domain-specific expert tool rather than guessing from raw interpretation.\",\n    \"Use anatomical/structural priors (e.g., typical positioning conventions) to constrain which answer options are plausible before committing.\",\n    \"Recognize when a single view cannot disambiguate laterality, and explicitly reason about what additional reference (frontal view, standard conventions) would resolve it.\",\n    \"Combine expert tool output with independent anatomical reasoning to cross-validate the final answer rather than relying on either alone.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Identify view-specific ambiguities (lateral vs frontal) and use expert tools to resolve laterality or localization questions; anchor reasoning in standard anatomical conventions.\",\n    \"Ambiguous evidence resolution\": \"When raw evidence admits multiple interpretations, route to a specialized analyzer and use domain priors to filter plausible answers.\",\n    \"Tool-assisted decision making\": \"Frame expert tool queries to directly address the ambiguity (e.g., 'which side appears elevated'), then reconcile tool output with independent reasoning.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm whether the imaging view (lateral/frontal) introduces laterality or localization ambiguity before answering.\",\n    \"Cross-check expert tool output against standard anatomical conventions to validate the final choice.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":553,"total_tokens":919,"completion_tokens":366,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":553},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":366}}}